The Mitre of Holiness works as a helm of brilliance, that is, for every
point it is enchanted, it will raise your Int and Wis by one point if you
wear it. So what you should do is enchant the Mitre, and then ditch the skull
cap. I'm not sure what the invokable power is, it was quite a while ago I
finished the priest quest (My priests usually die in the mines...)

>And is there a difference between 
>scale mails made from different dragons? Should I keep an assortment of 
>different dragon mails? And is a dragon scale mail the best body armor?
Yes, the dragon scale mail is the best body armour. The differences are
that they have built-in resistance depending on what kind of dragon the scales
are from (Black - disintegration, Gray - magic, Blue - ligthning etc)
In my opinion (probably shared by most of the readers) is that the Gray
version is the best one, since it gives you magic resistance, wich helps you
in various situations. However, it depends on what kind of intrisics you
already have.

